  "body": "From its sunny corner position to its thoughtful finishing touches, this brand-new home offers something special. Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas provide modern comfort, while generous outdoor spaces make it just as appealing outside.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen takes centre stage with a large island, flowing into open-plan dining and living. Step outside to the expansive deck, additional landscaping and lawn — a welcoming space for summer barbecues, children’s play and your four-legged family members.\r\n\r\nA downstairs bedroom and full bathroom offer flexibility for guests or extended family. Upstairs, a separate family lounge provides space to unwind, alongside three bedrooms, including a master with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Timber stairs with ambient step lighting add a stylish finishing touch.\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Downstairs bedroom and bathroom for added flexibility\r\n• Spacious kitchen with a generous central island\r\n• Separate upstairs family lounge\r\n• Large deck for outdoor dining and entertaining\r\n• Landscaped grounds and extra lawn space for children and pets\r\n• Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n• Timber stairs with ambient step lighting\r\n• Internal-access garage\r\n• Freehold title and CCC issued\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned for Silverdale’s shopping, local schools, motorway connections and the beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendor wants this home sold. Visit our open home or contact us for a private viewing.",
